{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "25", "m": "09", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "09", "M": "09", "S": "51"}}, "news": [{"title": "Nagpur civic body's panel seeks 50% tax penalty cut for small plots", "para": "Nagpur Municipal Corporation's tax assessment committee has requested a 50% waiver on penalties for property tax arrears. This waiver specifically targets economically weaker sections and small plot owners in the city. The committee expressed concerns about the burden on low-income citizens during the tax recovery process. They urged for verification regarding the issuance of demand bills before issuing warrants.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/nagpur-civic-bodys-panel-seeks-50-tax-penalty-cut-for-small-plots/134478089?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-93282/134478089.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "Saphalyam flat project in Thrikkakara set for DPR approval", "para": "Thrikkakara municipality is advancing with the Saphalyam flat initiative aimed at supporting economically challenged families. A key decision was finalized recently in Thiruvananthapuram to approve the construction of two towers for 78 families. Issues with land classification had previously delayed the project, but costs have been optimized, with the current estimate at around Rs 10 crore, reflecting adjustments from the original budget.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/saphalyam-flat-project-in-thrikkakara-set-for-dpr-approval/134478043?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-302466/134478043.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}, {"title": "Embassy REIT raises \u20b91,000 crore through first bank financing at trust level", "para": "Embassy Office Parks REIT has raised \u20b91,000 crore through three-year floating-rate NCDs subscribed by a European multinational bank. The transaction is the first bank financing to an Indian REIT at the trust level under the RBI\u2019s new lending framework.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/commercial/embassy-reit-raises-1000-crore-through-first-bank-financing-at-trust-level/134478290?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-96236/134478290.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "commercial"}]}